WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:33.833
describes one more such quality

3
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.333
that makes a devotee

4
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:38.333
most dear to Him.

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.750
This quality is remaining unaffected

6
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.916
by the ups and downs of life.

7
00:00:43.916 --> 00:00:44.916
An ideal devotee

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.166
neither becomes overly

9
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.166
elated upon gaining something,

10
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:52.291
nor overly distressed upon losing something.

11
00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:55.208
They neither regret the past,

12
00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:58.125
nor desire anything from the future.

13
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.916
They simply remain steady in their devotion,

14
00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:03.583
because they know that this world,

15
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:04.500
every thing in it,

16
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.250
every joy, every sorrow, all are temporary.

17
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.708
Whatever is happening

18
00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:12.291
is happening by Lord Krishna's will.

19
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:17.000
So they accept every moment with equanimity.

20
00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:22.833
Na hrishyati,

21
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.333
na dveshti, meaning an ideal devotee

22
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.166
neither feels excessive

23
00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:30.666
joy when something good happens,

24
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:33.708
nor is affected by excessive distress

25
00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:35.875
when something bad happens.

26
00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.750
In this material world, a person ordinarily

27
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.166
becomes elated when

28
00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.250
something they desired comes to them,

29
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.041
and when something precious

30
00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:46.958
is taken away, becomes sorrowful.

31
00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:50.416
But an ideal devotee knows that all of this

32
00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:51.833
is temporary.

33
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:52.958
Here today,

34
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:56.541
gone tomorrow, and for this
reason their inner peace

35
00:01:56.541 --> 00:02:00.208
is not affected by these external events.

36
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:03.875
Na shochati na kankshati, meaning
such a devotee

37
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.333
neither grieves over the past,

38
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:09.500
nor holds desires for the future.

39
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.875
Most people live their lives either

40
00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:14.166
in the regret of the past,

41
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:16.250
or the worry of the future.

42
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.041
But a devotee lives in the present.

43
00:02:19.041 --> 00:02:20.250
They accept every situation

44
00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.541
as Lord Krishna's arrangement.

45
00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:27.666
For them, real joy lies in the
relationship with Lord Krishna,

46
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:30.750
not in these worldly circumstances.

47
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.416
Shubhashubha-parityagi, meaning

48
00:02:33.416 --> 00:02:34.166
a devotee

49
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:35.750
gives up the very definitions

50
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.125
of auspicious and inauspicious.

51
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:40.791
For them, all are equal.

52
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:44.125
They neither wait for a favourable outcome,

53
00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:46.916
nor are frightened by a difficult one,

54
00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:48.666
because they trust

55
00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:51.166
that whatever the situation may be,

56
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:52.375
it is an opportunity

57
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:55.500
to draw closer to Lord Krishna.

58
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.208
They see all such situations as temporary,

59
00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:01.583
and never waver from their goal

60
00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:04.708
of devotion to Lord Krishna.

61
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.375
Lord Krishna says that such a devotee

62
00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:10.500
is most dear to Him.

63
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.416
This verse teaches us that beyond the material

64
00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:17.125
highs and lows, a steady and unshakeable mind

65
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:20.875
draws Lord Krishna's boundless love toward it.

66
00:03:20.875 --> 00:03:23.375
And the devotee who gives up worry

67
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:26.708
about results and remains
focused only on devotion

68
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:29.125
attains true peace

69
00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:31.666
and contentment.

70
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.708
Life suddenly brings

71
00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:42.208
many good and bad situations

72
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:45.416
before everyone,

73
00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:50.083
and in such moments it becomes very difficult

74
00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:53.666
to keep this mind at peace.

75
00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:58.708
Sometimes success comes beyond expectation,

76
00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:02.208
and the mind begins to touch the sky.

77
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.833
And sometimes

78
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:06.708
when defeat must be faced,

79
00:04:06.708 --> 00:04:11.125
that same mind becomes so distressed, as if

80
00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:14.333
everything is about to fall apart.

81
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:18.833
In gain, the mind fills with joy,

82
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:22.916
and in loss, with sorrow.

83
00:04:22.916 --> 00:04:25.833
Sometimes in hope for the future,

84
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:30.958
sometimes in regret over the past,
sometimes in joy,

85
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:34.583
sometimes in fear, sometimes in enthusiasm,

86
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:36.833
sometimes in worry.

87
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:41.083
The mind just keeps swinging.

88
00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:42.625
But

89
00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:45.166
ask yourself,

90
00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:48.166
can you ever find

91
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:51.875
lasting peace this way?

92
00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:53.500
No.

93
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.375
It is as if

94
00:04:56.375 --> 00:05:00.208
a child stands at the seashore.

95
00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:03.250
When a wave comes, they jump

96
00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.916
in such excitement,

97
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:08.500
as if they have found something priceless.

98
00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.625
But then

99
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:13.041
when that same wave recedes,

100
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:16.541
they begin to weep.

101
00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:18.333
But

102
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:20.458
an adult,

103
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:23.125
that person knows

104
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:27.333
that waves will keep coming and going.

105
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.291
This is the very nature of waves.

106
00:05:30.291 --> 00:05:35.083
So then why excitement and why weeping?

107
00:05:35.083 --> 00:05:38.375
Is life not the same?

108
00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:40.041
And is this not

109
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:42.750
its nature?

110
00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.666
Like waves,

111
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:47.333
good and bad times will come,

112
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:50.375
and will also go.

113
00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:54.083
So then why do you become excited or sorrowful 

114
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:58.583
like a child?

115
00:05:58.583 --> 00:06:00.083
But

116
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:02.583
the person who has

117
00:06:02.583 --> 00:06:07.166
devotion and spiritual depth in their heart,

118
00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:11.791
understands this instability of life.

119
00:06:11.791 --> 00:06:14.083
They know

120
00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:16.250
that if gain

121
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.541
will not last forever,

122
00:06:19.541 --> 00:06:24.291
then why excessive joy?

123
00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:26.000
And if

124
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.958
loss too is temporary,

125
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:35.666
then grieving over it is also unnecessary,
is it not?

126
00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:37.375
Think of this life

127
00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:42.291
as an ocean.

128
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:44.458
An ocean

129
00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:48.583
whose high and low waves will come,

130
00:06:48.583 --> 00:06:50.250
and will go,

131
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:55.166
giving you neither lasting happiness,

132
00:06:55.166 --> 00:06:57.750
nor lasting sorrow.

133
00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.416
The one who has internalised

134
00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:03.000
this spiritual knowledge

135
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.208
will then, in every situation,

136
00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:08.500
experience emotional stability

137
00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:13.125
and peace.

138
00:07:13.125 --> 00:07:15.166
Reflect on this.

139
00:07:20.041 --> 00:07:23.208
You will have seen this too,

140
00:07:23.208 --> 00:07:25.666
that in many families

141
00:07:25.666 --> 00:07:29.541
there is one person

142
00:07:29.541 --> 00:07:31.291
who remains calm even

143
00:07:31.291 --> 00:07:34.291
in difficult situations.

144
00:07:34.291 --> 00:07:37.541
They show no excess excitement at success,

145
00:07:37.541 --> 00:07:42.333
nor excessive sorrow at the time of failure.

146
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:44.000
About such a person

147
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.750
others often complain that

148
00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:52.000
this person is completely dull,

149
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.708
as if they have no heart,

150
00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:58.250
nor any feelings.

151
00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:01.875
But that is not so.

152
00:08:01.875 --> 00:08:05.125
Immersing deeply in devotion

153
00:08:05.125 --> 00:08:07.708
does not reduce feelings.

154
00:08:07.708 --> 00:08:12.791
These feelings simply find their right direction.

155
00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:15.416
Gain and loss, ups and downs,

156
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:18.666
all of this will continue in life,

157
00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:20.541
and a devotee

158
00:08:20.541 --> 00:08:23.000
knows this truth.

159
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.000
And so they do not waste their feelings

160
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.791
on these things.

161
00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:32.458
They invest their feelings,

162
00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:37.791
in devotion, in spirituality, in goodwill.

163
00:08:37.791 --> 00:08:40.250
They wish well for all,

164
00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:44.041
and hold no enmity with anyone.

165
00:08:44.041 --> 00:08:45.958
Think

166
00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:50.166
about how much love such a person carries.

167
00:08:50.166 --> 00:08:55.083
Then how can they be called dull?

168
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:57.500
The only difference is

169
00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.500
that this sweetness of devotion

170
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.916
cannot be understood

171
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.958
from a material perspective.

172
00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:07.625
Adopt a perspective of love,

173
00:09:07.625 --> 00:09:11.041
and in a devotee you will find

174
00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:13.583
both feelings,

175
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:15.916
and sweetness.

176
00:09:15.916 --> 00:09:17.708
And in the family where

177
00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:21.458
everyone inclines toward devotion,

178
00:09:21.458 --> 00:09:25.791
excitement and sorrow may lessen,

179
00:09:25.791 --> 00:09:28.375
but the love

180
00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:31.291
you find will be boundless.

181
00:09:31.291 --> 00:09:33.291
Draw your family

182
00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:36.791
toward devotion too.

183
00:09:36.791 --> 00:09:40.833
Because the family love born from this

184
00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:43.041
will never fade.

185
00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:50.250
Success and failure,

186
00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:54.250
ups and downs, praise, criticism,

187
00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.541
all of this is an inseparable part

188
00:09:57.541 --> 00:10:00.500
of professional life.

189
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.541
But all of this often

190
00:10:02.541 --> 00:10:06.625
exhausts and disturbs people.

191
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:10.375
Sometimes success fills with enthusiasm,

192
00:10:10.375 --> 00:10:14.250
then quickly failure comes

193
00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.583
and brings sorrow.

194
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:20.333
Sometimes someone praised you, and it feels

195
00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:24.041
as if you could conquer everything.

196
00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:26.916
And then one sharp criticism

197
00:10:26.916 --> 00:10:31.000
shatters your entire confidence.

198
00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.125
Think about this,

199
00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:35.666
if every rise and fall

200
00:10:35.666 --> 00:10:39.208
keeps troubling you like this,

201
00:10:39.208 --> 00:10:42.500
will you ever live a peaceful life?

202
00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.125
And yes,

203
00:10:45.125 --> 00:10:46.916
with such an unstable mind,

204
00:10:46.916 --> 00:10:51.125
will you be able to make progress?

205
00:10:51.125 --> 00:10:52.750
No.

206
00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.875
Always remember this truth of the Gita.

207
00:10:56.875 --> 00:11:01.833
Your control and authority

208
00:11:01.833 --> 00:11:04.583
is only over your actions,

209
00:11:04.583 --> 00:11:06.750
not over their results.

210
00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.250
And in professional life, these results

211
00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.875
depend on many things

212
00:11:12.875 --> 00:11:15.958
beyond your effort too,

213
00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:19.583
such as the external economic situation,

214
00:11:19.583 --> 00:11:23.000
the competence of your colleagues,

215
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.500
the decisions of senior officials, and so on.

216
00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.333
There are many such factors

217
00:11:28.333 --> 00:11:30.750
that influence the result.

218
00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.000
If you tie your state of mind

219
00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.750
only to the result,

220
00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.000
then in a way

221
00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:43.208
you have made your life and your progress too

222
00:11:43.208 --> 00:11:48.708
subject to all these external factors.

223
00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:51.083
Is that right?

224
00:11:51.083 --> 00:11:52.166
No.

225
00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:55.791
So instead of worrying excessively about results,

226
00:11:55.791 --> 00:11:58.416
focus your attention only

227
00:11:58.416 --> 00:12:01.666
on those things

228
00:12:01.666 --> 00:12:04.916
that are within your control,

229
00:12:04.916 --> 00:12:07.916
which is your dedication,

230
00:12:07.916 --> 00:12:11.458
your ethics, your work competence.

231
00:12:11.458 --> 00:12:15.833
And yes, most importantly,

232
00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:19.500
a positive outlook.

233
00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.625
This thinking

234
00:12:20.625 --> 00:12:23.333
will make you steady.

235
00:12:23.333 --> 00:12:27.291
Then neither will success bring you ego,

236
00:12:27.291 --> 00:12:31.708
nor will failure be able to break you.

237
00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:37.208
You simply keep doing your
work with dedication,

238
00:12:37.208 --> 00:12:40.916
and walking on this path, both spiritually

239
00:12:40.916 --> 00:12:42.458
and professionally,

240
00:12:42.458 --> 00:12:46.333
your progress will be certain.
